{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 84,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9041748046875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "detection among children (aged <10 years) living with HIV and with presumptive TB, compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968955993652344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        335.5882873535156,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "with a single LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample alone.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        526.8794555664062,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "In the hypothetical model that informed this study, a cohort of children with HIV and with signs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969056129455566,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        527.0028686523438,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "and symptoms of TB progressed through a decision analytical framework. In the intervention",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.9744262695312,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "arm, TB diagnosis involved the concurrent use of LC-aNAATs on both respiratory and stool",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        527.0910034179688,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "samples, alongside LF-LAM on urine. The comparator arm used LC-aNAAT on respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        526.9369506835938,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "samples alone. The probability of providing a respiratory sample was considered, and testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        526.9371337890625,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "was conducted, either concurrently on respiratory and stool samples alongside LF-LAM, or on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.9700927734375,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "stool alone alongside LF-LAM. In both the intervention and comparator arm, participants not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        527.0582885742188,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed through the diagnostic strategy had the opportunity for clinical diagnosis. Children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991246223449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        524.3433227539062,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "with bacteriologically confirmed TB underwent DST for rifampicin and began either drug-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.16522216796875,
        527.2477416992188,
        261.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "susceptible TB or DR-TB treatment, depending on the DST result. All individuals were followed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997650146484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.66522216796875,
        526.9701538085938,
        276.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "over time, including those with false negative or false positive diagnostic results, to account",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.16522216796875,
        438.51361083984375,
        292.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "for unnecessary treatment or additional mortality due to missed diagnoses.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        526.9651489257812,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "The study findings shown in   show the cost–effectiveness of the concurrent use  Table 2.3.3.1",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.9625244140625,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "of LC-aNAATs on respiratory and stool samples and LF-LAM on urine among children with HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        526.98095703125,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "in Malawi and the Philippines. In Malawi, the average cost of implementing an LC-aNAAT on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        526.9623413085938,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "a respiratory sample was US$ 319, with a corresponding average DALY of 5.08. When used",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        526.9776000976562,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "concurrently, the average cost increased to US$ 460, while the average DALY decreased to 1.8.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98378849029541,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.6690979003906,
        527.0336303710938,
        393.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "The resulting ICER per DALY averted was US$ 43 (95% UR: 28–89). Similarly, in the Philippines,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998749732971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        526.9656982421875,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "implementation of an LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample alone cost US$ 249, with an average",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.6690979003906,
        526.960205078125,
        424.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "DALY of 5.13, whereas concurrent use incurred an average cost of US$ 345 and an average",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.1690979003906,
        418.6640319824219,
        440.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "DALY of 1.77. The ICER per DALY averted was US$ 29 (95% UR: 18–63).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.955322265625,
        527.40966796875,
        469.0433044433594
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.3.3.1 Cost–effectiveness analysis of concurrent use of LC-aNAATs among",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.3553161621094,
        377.9460144042969,
        483.44329833984375
      ],
      "text": "children living with HIV in Malawi and the Philippines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
