      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        723.7277221679688,
        527.2845458984375,
        736.8727416992188
      ],
      "text": "More information on the cost–effectiveness analysis of concurrent use of tests in children with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997200012207031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
